        <item>
            <title>0.65</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:21:33 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202610141017</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.65</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The docs say what the station is now, each topic in one place</li>
<li>The tip wears its repo colour as a band at the thruster belt, its legs dark</li>
<li>Playbook entries set their stage at once and animate only their moment</li>
<li>The launch cam starts with the climb and frames the rocket</li>
<li>Sources sorted into State, Rules, Playback, Scene, Integrations, App and Tests</li>
<li>A test suite that checks rules, playback and intake in seconds</li>
<li>Rockets and staging are facts, and docking, loading and the climb are playback</li>
<li>Offices are facts, and their arrival and fold are playback</li>
<li>Crates follow the facts, and minions only show the change</li>
<li>The new rules run beside the ledger and every scenario checks they agree</li>
<li>Facts, the yard layout and the crate rules as pure code, with rule tests</li>
<li>The model owns the clock; the scene only draws</li>
<li>The whole gate runs in under twenty seconds</li>
<li>Hotfix PRs get their own rocket, both rockets share one shape, and a pad lift docks them</li>
<li>The pad wall is a glass pane until a vortex forms, and the dome glass is a faint wireframe</li>
<li>Neighbours get a panel of their own, share in real time and mingle on the station</li>
<li>One session keeps one office after its pull request merges</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
